  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/upZiz61.png\" alt=\"Сажевые трубы\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Добавляет трубы из <strong>кирпича, булыжника, каменного кирпича, глинобитного кирпича, железа, меди</strong> и <strong>терракоты</strong>, издающие частицы дыма.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/H4YUooO.png\" alt=\"Особенности\" width=\"1000\" height=\"774\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Sooty Chimneys был показан в видео от <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Boodlyneck\" rel=\"nofollow\">Boodlyneck</a>&nbsp;(на отметке <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ICobJ1QU598&t=293s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">4:52</a>):</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ICobJ1QU598?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&bull;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Играете на Fabric 1.20 или ниже? Вот порт:</span>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sooty Chimneys для Fabric</a> от&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/otomir23/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">otomir23</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Сервер Discord\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Нравится мод?&nbsp;Ваша поддержка позволит мне продолжать работу над ним и над другими модами!</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"550\" height=\"108\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal.png\" alt=\"PayPal\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Посмотрите мои другие моды:</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"Exposure\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/envelope\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"Envelope\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L5IBBEH.png\" alt=\"Chalk\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpmC8km.png\" alt=\"Wares\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Le5yWV.png\" alt=\"Monobank\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/thief/main.png\" alt=\"Thief\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NhbmXO8.png\" alt=\"Salt\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scholar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/main-512.png\" alt=\"Scholar\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/horseman/main.png\" alt=\"Horseman\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
